# Git policy

- After substantive work, commit with a good message
  (Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>).
- Do not push until a remote exists and Sam asks, or a local mirror
  is attached the way sister tools use `D:/git-mirrors/`.
- **Never publish to npm.** Do not run `npm publish`, `pnpm publish`,
  or `yarn npm publish`. The user publishes. `gaplast@0.0.0` is a
  name hold, not this tree.
